																	<span class="m27__single-item__tag tag">Events</span>
								
								<h3 class="m27__single-item__heading heading heading--6">SMART DATA FORUM KEYNOTE: Spotlight on the Open Banking Roadmap</h3>

																	<time class="m27__single-item__date">15 Jun 2026</time>
								
								<span class="button--icon-download read-more m27__single-item__button">
									<span>Download</span>
								</span>

