<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-50"><strong>Day 1</strong> &#8211; <strong>Tuesday 21 October</strong></h2>



<div style="height:62px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div id="1" class="wp-block-group is-style-custom-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
