<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Innovation Exchange</strong> </h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong>Voices from the Edge: Start-Ups Shaping the Future</strong></strong></h5>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Hear directly from the challengers and start-ups shaping tomorrow’s services. They’ll share ambitions and roadblocks at the edge of innovation &#8211; giving senior leaders a candid look at what’s needed to scale new ideas and sustain competition.</p>



<p class="has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-51 wp-block-paragraph"><strong><strong>Panel</strong></strong></p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Mel Lazarus</strong>, Ecosystem Engagement Director, OBL &#8211; <strong>Moderator</strong></li>



<li><strong>Charlie Mercer,</strong> Start-up Coalition</li>



<li><strong>Luke Ladyman,</strong> Debitscore by Cheddar</li>



<li><strong>Wayne Lloyd,</strong> Smarter Contracts</li>
</ul>
</div>



