<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Innovation Exchange</strong></h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong>Innovation That Delivers: Real-World Impact</strong></strong></h5>



<p class="has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color has-regular-font-size wp-elements-52 wp-block-paragraph"><strong>12:30 &#8211; 13:00</strong> &#8211; <strong>Open mic debate</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Innovation is only meaningful when it delivers for people and businesses. This session highlights real-world applications driving adoption among SMEs and consumers and explores what it takes to scale trust and impact.&nbsp;</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Panel</strong></h6>



