<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Innovation Exchange</strong></h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong>Breaking Barriers: Cross-Industry Collaboration at Work</strong></strong></h5>



<p class="has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-53 wp-block-paragraph"><strong>14:00 &#8211; 14:30</strong> &#8211; <strong>Open mic debate</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Digital ID, property data, sustainability, financial inclusion &#8211; innovation rarely moves forward in isolation. Leaders from across industries share how multi-stakeholder collaboration is breaking down barriers and creating new opportunities.&nbsp;</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Panel</strong></h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
