<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-54"><strong>Day 2 </strong>&#8211; <strong>Wednesday 22 October</strong></h2>



<div style="height:64px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-style-custom-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Innovation Exchange</strong></h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong><strong>Innovation Meets Regulation: The Balancing Act</strong></strong></strong></h5>



<p class="has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-55 wp-block-paragraph"><strong>10:15 &#8211; 10:45</strong> &#8211; <strong>Open mic debate</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">How do regulation and innovation fuel each other? Senior figures from regulators, banks, and fintechs debate the costs, frictions, and opportunities. The UK model is in focus: can standards become the ultimate enabler of trust and adoption at scale.&nbsp;</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Panel</strong></h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Nick Davey</strong>, OBL &#8211; <strong>Moderator</strong></li>



<li><strong>Araba Eshun</strong>, Plaid</li>



<li><strong>Adam Jackson</strong>, Innovate Finance</li>



<li><strong>Chris Hemsley,</strong> Fingleton</li>
</ul>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
<div style="height:14px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="578" src="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-1024x578.png" alt="" class="wp-image-25512" srcset="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-1024x578.png 1024w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-300x169.png 300w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-768x433.png 768w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-1536x867.png 1536w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-375x212.png 375w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-512x289.png 512w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-100x56.png 100w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-78x44.png 78w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-43x24.png 43w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-28x16.png 28w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-70x39.png 70w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-82x46.png 82w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-175x99.png 175w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-344x194.png 344w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619.png 1831w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>



