<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Innovation Exchange</strong></h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong>The UK Blueprint: From Open Banking to Open Finance&nbsp;</strong></strong></h5>



<p class="has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-56 wp-block-paragraph"><strong><strong>12:00 &#8211; 12:30</strong></strong> &#8211; <strong>In Conversation</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">What does the UK’s financial innovation blueprint really look like? Adam Jackson, Strategy Director at Innovate Finance and Luke Ryder will explore the sector’s most pressing questions &#8211; from the role of Standards and building trust; to how collaboration is accelerating the journey towards open finance.</p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Panel</strong></h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Luke Ryder</strong>, Standards, Strategic Policy &amp; Public Affairs Director, OBL &#8211; <strong>Moderator</strong></li>



<li><strong>Adam Jackson,</strong> Innovate Finance</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<div style="height:64px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-style-custom-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Innovation Exchange</strong></h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><strong><strong>From UK to the World: Open Banking as</strong> <strong>an</strong> <strong>Export</strong></strong></strong></h5>



<p class="has-magenta-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-57 wp-block-paragraph"><strong>13:30 &#8211; 14:00</strong> &#8211; <strong>Open mic debate</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">With the UK’s open banking framework setting a global benchmark, the question now is: how do we take it international? This session examines the opportunities and hurdles in exporting the UK model, from interoperability to regulatory readiness, and what it means for businesses seeking to scale across borders.&nbsp;</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-magenta-color has-text-color"><strong>Panel</strong></h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Henk Van Hulle,</strong> CEO OBL &#8211; <strong>Moderator</strong></li>



<li><strong>Tom Trundle-Martin</strong>, Truelayer</li>



<li><strong>Robert Sullivan</strong>, Token.io</li>



<li><strong>Ana Abrão, </strong>CEO, Open Finance Brasil&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:50%">
<div style="height:14px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><a href="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/multimedia/from-uk-to-the-world-open-banking-as-an-export/"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="578" src="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-1024x578.png" alt="" class="wp-image-25512" srcset="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-1024x578.png 1024w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-300x169.png 300w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-768x433.png 768w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-1536x867.png 1536w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-375x212.png 375w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-512x289.png 512w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-100x56.png 100w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-78x44.png 78w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-43x24.png 43w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-28x16.png 28w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-70x39.png 70w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-82x46.png 82w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-175x99.png 175w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619-344x194.png 344w, https://www.openbanking.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/Screenshot-2025-11-18-152619.png 1831w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a></figure>



