		<item>
		<title>OBL at Open Banking Expo – London 2024</title>
		<link>https://www.openbanking.org.uk/news/obl-at-open-banking-expo-london-2024/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Patrick Cannon]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 08:10:12 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Events]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.openbanking.qa/?p=23506</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Once again, the OBL team will be at Open Banking Expo at the Business Design Centre, Upper Street, London N1 0QH on 15-16 October. We look forward to meeting members of the ecosystem, industry leaders, regulators and more to discuss the future of open banking as it transitions to open finance and smart data. Come [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/news/obl-at-open-banking-expo-london-2024/">OBL at Open Banking Expo – London 2024</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.openbanking.org.uk">Open Banking</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Once again, the <strong>OBL team</strong> will be at <strong><a href="https://www.openbankingexpo.com/uk/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Open Banking Expo</a></strong> at the Business Design Centre, Upper Street, London N1 0QH on 15-16 October.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We look forward to meeting members of the ecosystem, industry leaders, regulators and more to discuss the future of open banking as it transitions to open finance and smart data.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Come and visit us at Stand G24</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The team will also be speaking at the following sessions:</p>



<div style="height:70px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-style-custom-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-teal-color has-text-color">Smart Data Show</h6>



<h5 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Panel and open Q&amp;A</strong>: The way to Financial Data Access </h5>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Date</strong>: Tuesday 15 October<br><strong>Time</strong>: 11.15 &#8211; 12.15<br>The&nbsp;scope and characteristics of the Framework for Financial Data Access (FiDA) from the implementation lens – how is data exchange going to work with the number of players coming together and entering the ecosystem, and will this lead to differing national implementations across the EU.</p>



<article class="wp-block-luna-button luna-button"><a class="button button--icon-chevron" href="https://www.openbankingexpo.com/uk/agenda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="button__label">View the full agenda here</span></a></article>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><br></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-blue-color has-text-color">OBL Speakers</h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><a href="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/profile/executive-committee/henk-van-hulle/">Henk Van Hulle</a>, OBL CEO</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<div style="height:64px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-style-custom-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-teal-color has-text-color"><strong>Main stage</strong>:</h6>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Chatham House Rules:  How can banks inwardly benefit from Open Banking and traverse beyond being a regulatory mandated pipe?</strong></h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Date</strong>: Wednesday 16 October<br><strong>Time</strong>: 11:05 &#8211; 11:30</p>



<article class="wp-block-luna-button luna-button"><a class="button button--icon-chevron" href="https://www.openbankingexpo.com/uk/agenda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="button__label">View the full agenda here</span></a></article>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-blue-color has-text-color">OBL speakers</h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Nick Davey, OBL Senior Policy and Strategy Lead </li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:64px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<div style="height:64px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-style-custom-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66.66%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-teal-color has-text-color"><strong>Open Finance Show</strong>:</h6>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">Expanding the scope: Open Banking and beyond for the non-mandated&nbsp;</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Date</strong>: Wednesday 16 October<br><strong>Time</strong>: 14.45 &#8211; 15.35&nbsp;</p>



<article class="wp-block-luna-button luna-button"><a class="button button--icon-chevron" href="https://www.openbankingexpo.com/uk/agenda/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="button__label">View the full agenda here</span></a></article>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33.33%">
<h6 class="wp-block-heading has-blue-color has-text-color">OBL Speakers</h6>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Christian Delesalle, OBL Head of Participant Support&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:64px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



