		<item>
		<title>OBL at the Labour Party and Conservative Party conferences 2024</title>
		<link>https://www.openbanking.org.uk/news/obl-at-labour-party-and-conservative-party-conferences-2024/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Patrick Cannon]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Thu, 29 Aug 2024 10:00:37 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Events]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.openbanking.qa/?p=23198</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Open Banking Limited (OBL) will be attending Labour Party and Conservative Party Conferences this year to highlight how open banking is driving financial innovation, bringing wide-ranging benefits to consumers and SMEs, and acting as the foundation and a catalyst for a smart data economy. As well as hosting panels on ‘Open Banking to Open Energy: [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.openbanking.org.uk/news/obl-at-labour-party-and-conservative-party-conferences-2024/">OBL at the Labour Party and Conservative Party conferences 2024</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.openbanking.org.uk">Open Banking</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Open Banking Limited (OBL) will be attending Labour Party and Conservative Party Conferences this year to highlight how open banking is driving financial innovation, bringing wide-ranging benefits to consumers and SMEs, and acting as the foundation and a catalyst for a smart data economy.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As well as hosting panels on ‘<strong>Open Banking to Open Energy: Unlocking the digital economy’</strong> at both conferences, we will be asking both parties to support the swift passage of the Digital Information and Smart Data (DISD) Bill through Parliament.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This Bill, which has cross-party support, is vital to unlocking economic and societal benefits from the expansion of open banking, the UK’s first smart data scheme, in key sectors such as energy, finance, home-buying, retail, telecoms and transport. It will also help deliver productivity gains, financial inclusion, and reduce the cost of living for our citizens and small businesses.</p>



<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Event details</strong></h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>These sessions will explore how we can replicate and leverage the success of open banking as we move towards open finance and other smart data schemes – and how we bring their benefits into fruition in other sectors, including energy.</strong></p>



<div style="height:70px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66%">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>The Labour Party Annual Conference </strong></h4>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Open Banking to Open Energy: Unlocking the data economy</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Monday, September 23, 2024</strong><br>12:00-13:00</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Location: </strong>SME4Labour pod (secure zone), Arena&nbsp;Room&nbsp;7<br>This event is in the secure zone, requiring a conference pass for access.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Tickets:</strong>&nbsp;Free, but booking is required<br></p>



<article class="wp-block-luna-button luna-button"><a class="button button--icon-chevron" href="https://sme4labour.org/sme-events/open-banking-an-engine-for-the-future/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="button__label">Book tickets</span></a></article>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33%">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Speakers</h4>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Sheldon Mills</strong>, Executive Director, FCA (Financial Conduct Authority)</li>



<li><strong>Elena Pérez Celis</strong>, Head of Policy and Public Affairs,&nbsp;B4NZ (Business for Net Zero)</li>



<li><strong>Henk Van Hulle</strong>, CEO, Open Banking</li>



<li><strong>Gavin Starks</strong>, Founder and CEO, Icebreaker One</li>



<li><strong>Luke Charters MP</strong>, Member of Parliament for York Outer</li>



<li><strong>Cllr Geoff Barraclough</strong> – Cabinet Member for Planning and Economic Development</li>



<li><strong>Chair: David Burton-Sampson MP</strong> – Member of Parliament for Southend West and Leigh</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div style="height:100px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<div style="height:100px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:66%">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>The Conservative Party Annual Conference </strong></h4>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Open Banking to Open Energy: Unlocking the data economy</strong><br><br><strong>Monday, September 30, 2024</strong><br>14:30-15:30</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Location: </strong>ConHome marquee (secure zone)</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="Open Banking to Open Energy: Unlocking the data economy" width="500" height="281" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/yckEYePHcTw?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><br></p>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow" style="flex-basis:33%">
<h4 class="wp-block-heading">Speakers</h4>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Sheree Howard,</strong> Executive Director, Financial Conduct Authority</li>



<li><strong>Hannah Cool,</strong> Chief Operating Officer, B4NZ (Business for Net Zero)</li>



<li><strong>Marion King</strong>, Trustee, Open Banking Limited&nbsp;</li>



<li><strong>Emma Pinchbeck</strong>, CEO, Energy UK&nbsp;</li>



<li><strong>Shadow Minister </strong>(tbc)&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>



