							<div class="m27__single-item__content">

																	<span class="m27__single-item__tag tag">Report</span>
								
								<h3 class="m27__single-item__heading heading heading--6">OBL&#8217;s response to JROC&#8217;s proposal for the design of the future entity for open banking</h3>

																	<time class="m27__single-item__date">20 May 2024</time>
								
								<span class="button--icon-download read-more m27__single-item__button">
									<span>Download</span>
								</span>

							</div>

